      "review_summary": "The PR adds a 30-second SCP timeout, SIGKILL kill path, and settled guard in sandbox media staging.\n\nPR surface: Source +22. Total +22 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-reproducible: current main `scpFile()` awaits only child `error` or `exit`, so a child that remains running keeps the Promise pending. I did not run a live hung SCP transfer in this read-only review.",
